  "strings": [
    "At last the Balrog of Morgoth is broken and has been cast down.\u0000",
    "Returning to the bottomless pits of Moria.\u0000",
    "The ancestral home of the Dwarves has now been reclaimed.\u0000",
    "And the creatures that infested it flee our wrath.\u0000",
